name: The Trio — three-of-a-kind X3
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Trio gives X3 Mult if the played hand contains a Three of a Kind. First-shop X3
  engine: Zany Joker, Wily Joker, and Oops All 6s? No, just commit to Three of a Kind.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: TheTrio
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: ZanyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: WilyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheIdol
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
